<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 16.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 16.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Friday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Kalamazoo Hlds	  19.25   2.39</p>
<p> 2   Pac Mutal Aust	  12.45   2.41</p>
<p> 3   Villa World	     10.48   1.05</p>
<p> 4   Kurts (P) Prop	  10.42   1.44</p>
<p> 5   Multistack		10.34   0.29</p>
<p> 6   Prime Credit Tr	 10.32   0.95</p>
<p> 7   Indu Property	   10.11   0.90</p>
<p> 8   BT Prop Trust	    9.95   1.64</p>
<p> 9   Prop Income Inv	  9.91   1.03</p>
<p>10   Colonial Mutual	  9.80   1.08</p>
<p>11   Central Equity	   9.47   0.95</p>
<p>12   Gandel Retail Tr	 8.97   0.87</p>
<p>13   Nth Building Soc	 8.91   2.58</p>
<p>14   Centro Prop		8.90   2.19</p>
<p>15   Gen Prop Tr		8.82   2.28</p>
<p>16   Barclays Mirvac	  8.80   1.25</p>
<p>17   Armstrong Retail	 8.78   0.74</p>
<p>18   Aust Tour		  8.62   0.87</p>
<p>19   Advance Pro CB	   8.59   1.35</p>
<p>20   Westpac Prop Tr	  8.58   1.58</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
